  "description": "# TNT Duper\n\n![TNT Duper cover image](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Sekai0NI0itamio/tnt-duper/main/.modcompiler-art/description-image.webp)\n\nAllows dispensers to duplicate TNT without using up the TNT item.\n\n### What It Does\n\n- Power a dispenser that contains TNT and it will spawn a TNT that is lighted.\n- The TNT item used to trigger the dispenser remains in the dispenser, so you can keep using it without it running out.\n\n### Features\n\n- Infinite TNT dispensing from a single TNT item.\n- Works with any dispenser that holds TNT.\n- Compatible with vanilla TNT mechanics (same explosion behavior).\n- Works on both single‑player and multiplayer worlds.\n\n### Why Use This Mod?\n\n- Build automatic TNT farms without constantly refilling dispensers.\n- Simplify redstone contraptions that need repeated TNT bursts.\n- Save time and resources when testing explosions.\n- Easy to use – just place a dispenser and watch it duplicate TNT.\n\n## What You'll Notice\n\n- Dispensers can fire TNT without using up the TNT item.\n- The spawned TNT behaves like normal TNT and can be picked up or detonated.",
